			<Comment>♂：わざおすすめにん
・01～05のそれぞれ20％で
　ランダムに表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T02:58:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T02:58:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
